dzn: Report Vulkan 1.3 on shader model 6.6 devices with wave operations

Adds the Vulkan 1.3 core features to Dozen: VK_KHR_vulkan_memory_model,
VK_KHR_maintenance4, VK_EXT_inline_uniform_block, VK_EXT_extended_dynamic_state
and extended_dynamic_state2, VK_EXT_image_robustness, pipeline creation cache
control and feedback, VK_KHR_format_feature_flags2, shader terminate
invocation and demote to helper invocation, zero-initialized workgroup memory,
8-bit and 16-bit integers and storage without native 16-bit operations, and
the extensions that were already implemented but not exposed. Devices below
shader model 6.6 or without wave operations keep reporting 1.2.

